sequenceDiagram
participant Main
participant Device as DeviceInterface
participant Sensor as SensorSimulator
participant Analyzer as HealthAnalyzer
participant Logger

Main->>Device: readDevice()
Device->>Sensor: read()
Sensor-->>Device: BiometricData
Device-->>Main: BiometricData
Main->>Analyzer: analyze(data)
Analyzer-->>Main: AnalysisResult
Main->>Logger: write(data,result)
Logger-->>Main: record stored
